      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Always check a missing value by putting it back into the original expression.\n\nThis catches sign mistakes and also catches a value that solves a simplified line but was copied wrongly.\n\nThe check should reproduce the exact number on the other side.",
